.TH V2_SUB 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
v2_sub \- Component\-wise difference a \- b: the vector from b to a
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqmathx.h\(dq
.BI "Vec2 v2_sub(Vec2 a, Vec2 b);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Component\-wise difference a \- b: the vector from b to a. v2_sub(target, pos) points from pos toward target.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
a \- b.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/mathx.h)
